OL,3,GNEWSAChildminder facing 'severe
OL,4,Afinancial burden' as heating oil costs
OL,5,Arise
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany households across Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fcontinue to be hit with high prices for
OL,9,Fhome heating oil, with one woman saying
OL,10,Fthere is a "severe" financial burden on
OL,11,Fchildminders.
OL,13,FThe war in Iran is having a practical
OL,14,Fimpact on people across the island as
OL,15,Fenergy prices continue to climb.
OL,17,FOn 24 September, the average price of
OL,18,F500 litres of home heating oil in
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland was #561.83, according
OL,20,Fto the Consumer Council NI (CCNI).
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
