OL,3,GNEWSAChildminder facing 'severe
OL,4,Afinancial burden' as heating oil costs
OL,5,Arise
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's a severe financial and
OL,8,Foperational burden on all registered
OL,9,Fchildminders because as well as the
OL,10,Fprices of the oil, there's massive
OL,11,Fincreases in the food bills, the
OL,12,Finsurance," Rachel Jeffers, from
OL,13,FStewartstown, County Tyrone said.
